{"id":"wh-cleft","lv":"c1","n":5,"cat":"emphasis","t":"What … is, All … is: đưa trọng tâm ra cuối","en":"What happened was… · All I did was… · That's what…","sum":"Câu chẻ với What / All ở trình độ cao: dồn phần quan trọng xuống cuối câu, nơi người nghe chú ý nhất. What happened was (that) + mệnh đề: mở đầu một lời kể, giải thích (What happened was that my car broke down). Nhấn cả một hành động: What + chủ ngữ + do / did + is / was + (to) nguyên thể (What I did was call the police). All I did was + nguyên thể = tôi chỉ… thôi, thường hàm ý “có gì to tát đâu” (All I did was ask a question). Đảo lại, rất hay gặp khi nói: That's what I mean. · That's why… · That's where you're wrong. Cùng họ: The thing is, … · The reason (why)… is that… (văn viết trang trọng tránh the reason… is because).","forms":[{"f":"What happened was (that) + mệnh đề","vi":"What happened was that the car broke down."},{"f":"What + S + do / did + is / was + (to) nguyên thể","vi":"What I did was call the police."},{"f":"All + S + V + is / was… (= chỉ… thôi)","vi":"All I did was ask a question."},{"f":"That's what / why / where… · The thing is, …","vi":"That's what I mean."}],"pts":[{"id":"wh-cleft-advanced","name":"Wh-clefts (advanced)","vi":"What happened was…, What he did was (to)…, That's what…"},{"id":"all-cleft","name":"All-clefts","vi":"All I want is…: chỉ, mỗi"}],"cast":{"mia":{"name":{"en":"Mia","vi":"Mia"},"look":"woman","style":{"outfit":"blouse","top":"#D9774F","topShade":"#BF6340","accent":"#C8603B","hair":"long","hairColor":"#6B4226"},"x":560},"leo":{"name":{"en":"Leo","vi":"Leo"},"look":"man","style":{"outfit":"tee","top":"#3E8E7E","topShade":"#32766A","collar":"#32766A","accent":"#2F7D6D","hairColor":"#3B2A20"},"x":1040}},"bg":"home-lake","props":[{"id":"flowers","x":820}],"beats":[{"k":"e","sec":"hook","en":"Leo! Dinner started an hour ago. What happened?","vi":"Leo! Bữa tối bắt đầu từ một tiếng trước rồi. Có chuyện gì vậy?","ipa":["ˈlioʊ","ˈdɪnɚ","ˈstɑɹtɪd","æn","ˈaʊɚ","əˈɡoʊ","wʌt",